\nAWESOME YOUTUBE VID!<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\nbetter yet, they are actually making a NEW one this year! I'm deffo getting it!<br/>\n<br/>\n<div style=\"margin:20px;margin-top:5px\">\n<div class=\"smallfont\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px\">Quote:</div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">\n<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tOriginally Posted by <strong>Wyvern</strong>\n<a href=\"archive.php?t=3605&amp;p=3#post43247\">View Post</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-style:italic\"><a href=\"http://javascript&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:void(0);\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165343im_/http://i216.photobucket.com/albums/cc130/halo1873/CD%20cover/MafiaUSCov.jpg\"/></a></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>Also this ^<br/>\n<br/>\nI remember my dad wouldn't let me get it when it came out after he watched me play the Demo. I didn't realise he was watching and I walked up behind an old lady and clubbed her into the back of the head. LOlololololo","sig":"<div>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/4455f842d80d3dce.jpg\"/><br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165343im_/http://i35.tinypic.com/10ncahw.jpg\"/><br/>\r\nFollow me on Twitter! <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/letomg0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.twitter.com/letomg0</a>\n</div>"},{"pid":43279,"num":39,"date":"2010-01-05T00:10:00","author":"Zargero","usertitle":"Junior Member","joined":"Jan 2010","author_posts":6,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"Does this count?<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165343im_/http://cdn.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/4000/header.jpg?t=1252959258\"/><br/>\r\nIf not<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165343im_/http://www.thedailycontributor.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/08/zombies-ate-my-neighbors-snes-cover.jpg\"/>","sig":""},{"pid":43283,"num":40,"date":"2010-01-05T00:22:00","author":"HawkAce","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":398,"title":null,"edited":"Last edited by HawkAce; Today at 12:35 AM .","html":"Clown... Syff...<br/>\nRead the year; around the same age as Duke Nukem. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quake\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quake</a>  -.-<br/>\nNewfags   &gt;:3<br/>\n<br/>\nAnd Mafia is a much younger game. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mafia_%28video_game%29\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mafia_%28video_game%29</a><br/>\n<br/>\nHmmmm. =P","sig":""},{"pid":43290,"num":28,"date":"2010-01-05T00:39:00","author":"HawkAce","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":398,"title":null,"edited":"Last edited by HawkAce; Today at 12:43 AM .","html":"Both of you didn't know Quake was that old? =o<br/>\nxD","sig":""},{"pid":43297,"num":1,"date":"2010-01-05T00:50:00","author":"Moriarty","usertitle":"Senior Member","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":554,"title":null,"edited":"Last edited by Moriarty; Today at 12:52 AM .","html":"<div style=\"margin:20px;margin-top:5px\">\n<div class=\"smallfont\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px\">Quote:</div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">\n<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tOriginally Posted by <strong>HawkAce</strong>\n<a href=\"archive.php?t=3605&amp;p=4#post43290\">View Post</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-style:italic\">Both of you didn't know Quake was that old? =o<br/>\nxD</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>I knew. In fact the reason I know this is I remember playing Duke Nukem and 3D Realms decided to add a little joke in it.<br/>\n<br/>\nIn one part, an earthquake occurs. Duke then adds the quip \"I ain't afraid of no quake.\" This was actually a reference to Quake coming out around the same time as Duke Nukem. Of course, 3D Realms (which was called Apogee Games back in 1990) produced many of id Software's games such as Commander Keen, Wolfenstein 3D, and Spear of Destiny. However, they broke off from them, made their own games, and ended up changing their names to 3D Realms. Rise of the Triad was originally going to be a sequel to Wolfenstein 3D with an upgraded engine. Apogee made Blake Stone: Aliens of Gold in 1993, but it was unable to compete with Doom.","sig":"<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\"No, generally I think influence is used as a nice word for plagiarism.\" -Gilbert Gottfried<br/>\n<br/>\n\"Adventures suck when you're having them.\" -Neil Peart<font face=\"monospace\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><br/>\n<br/>\n</font></font>\"Focus is a matter of deciding what things you're not going to do.\" -John Carmack\r\n\t\t\t</div>"},{"pid":43314,"num":51,"date":"2010-01-05T02:08:00","author":"KiZai","usertitle":"Super Administrator","joined":"Nov 2008","author_posts":1523,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"Fuck you and your pictures, I made a <i><b>video.</b></i><br/>\n<br/>\n<i><font color=\"Red\"><b>Video removed due to hearning Elkinda rage halfway through.</b></font></i><br/>\n<br/>\n-KiZai","sig":"<div>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/60bd6848019e4347.jpg\"/>\n</div>"},{"pid":43316,"num":52,"date":"2010-01-05T02:26:00","author":"HawkAce","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":398,"title":null,"edited":"Last edited by HawkAce; Today at 02:29 AM .","html":"I wanna play the all the Sonics now...<br/>\nWas that recorded with fraps Kizai? =P","sig":""},{"pid":43397,"num":53,"date":"2010-01-05T14:35:00","author":"KiZai","usertitle":"Super Administrator","joined":"Nov 2008","author_posts":1523,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"Re-recorded for maximum ass kickage.<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n-KiZai","sig":"<div>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/60bd6848019e4347.jpg\"/>\n</div>"},{"pid":43398,"num":54,"date":"2010-01-05T14:46:00","author":"JotaDe","usertitle":"Regular","joined":"Jul 2009","author_posts":251,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165112im_/http://www.ecbloguer.com/misiondiversion/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/01_aoe2.jpg\"/>","sig":""},{"pid":43401,"num":55,"date":"2010-01-05T15:13:00","author":"Cyber Muffin","usertitle":"Donator","joined":"May 2009","author_posts":390,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165112im_/http://is2.myvideo.de/de/user_pics/32/grppic_2737532_Clonk.gif\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nClonk. Don't know if anyone knows this game. I actually liked this game so much so I bought the newest version of it once. <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100105165112im_/http://www.ventmob.com/images/smilies/biggrin.gif\" title=\"Big Grin\"/>","sig":""},{"pid":43404,"num":56,"date":"2010-01-05T15:50:00","author":"YardiThomas","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Jun 2009","author_posts":135,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"Epic Game ^.","sig":"<div>\n<a href=\"http://i284.photobucket.com/albums/ll21/thomasmo/stuff/Sig2.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://i284.photobucket.com/albums/l...stuff/Sig2.png</a><br/>\r\n-YardiThomas-\r\n\t\t\t</div>"},{"pid":43405,"num":57,"date":"2010-01-05T16:01:00","author":"patatkraam","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":1789,"title":null,"edited